<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="RUT" style="id">- Lontomba</book>
  <para style="h">LUTA</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lut</para>
  <para style="toc2">LUTA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Buku enka Luta</para>
  <para style="mt1">Luta</para>
  <para style="imt">Mabandelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Nsango enka Luta etepwamaki o elaka enka bato bambobeyamake Batendi, bambɔkɛndiake bato ba Isalaele; ya ɛkɛtɛmɛki o lombiha, elaka elɔkɔ epoisie nwebana bɔlɔti.</para>
  <para style="ip">Itina imɔ inka monkanda itepwama na boili nde ile nwɛnia lolenge lonka ngainto o mobutu ɔtwaki o iyɔngɔ inka bato banka Nyambe. Na itina ilɔkɔ nsɛkɔ eiko etepela penda na ipiki inka Luta, mohi Moaba, onga na bokundu bonka bome o nande mpe onga na Nyambe enka Isalaele. Ɛtwɛnia lolenge loutamaki ipiki ilɔkɔ o mbiha: nyaima o mahɛi o ibando iliki balɔkɔ, Luta na bokilo bo nande Naomi banyɛngwamaki bɔkɛ bɔkɛ na mbati. Nsɛkɔ eiko ɛkɛtɛmɛki o lolenge lɔ lɔlɔti, nopa lwɛlia lɔ ipiki o iyɔngɔ inka bato mpe nwambela Nyambe.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mabotameno manka ngana o mwele onka Luta male motu mo lobo monka nsɛkɔ: ngana ɔlɔkɔ angoyala nke enka nkumu Dawidi. Nzayala o inkana inka Dawidi, Luta mohi Moaba ale na manda onka ba nke banka Yesu (Mat 1.5).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="RUT 1" />
  <para style="s1">Mahɛi ma bokundu bonka Elimɛlɛkɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 1:1" />O elaka ɛkɛndiamaki Isalaele na batɛndi, molaka mo nzala mokitaki o ehe ɛ nɛnɛ. Na boiko, moto ɔmɔ o Bɛtɛlɛmɛ e Yuda ahaki nde na mwali na bana banande ba mele bape; bahaki nokiha ngano elaka o ehe ɛ nɛnɛ e Moaba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">o elaka ekataki batɛndi bonkumu o Isalaele: elimbola mbɔ bɛlɛbɛlɛ na mobu nkoto ɛmɔ na monkama boho bo mabotameno manka Yesu Kilito, lendaka mpe o buku enka Batɛndi. Moaba: lɔbɔmbi lɔ bɔmpɔu lole o lokenge lɔbɛlɛ mɔnyɛnɛ o ebale etangema ebale e Iwa.</char></note>. <verse eid="RUT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 1:2" />Moto ɔlɔkɔ lina inande Elimɛlɛkɛ, mwali onande lina Naomi mpe bana banande ɔnɛ lina Maloni mpe onkina lina Kilioni; baliki ɔ mɔnkɔndu monka Epalata o Bɛtɛlɛmɛ e Yuda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Epalata: bokundu bonka Yuda bole o Bɛtɛlɛmɛ, ehe ele tango na ngano ba kilomɛtɛlɛ o sude enka Yelusalɛmɛ.</char></note>. Baiyaki o ehe ɛ nɛnɛ e Moaba mpe bakihaki, <verse eid="RUT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 1:3" />Elimɛlɛkɛ aowa mpe Naomi aopali nde na bana banande bape ba mele. <verse eid="RUT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 1:4" />Balɔkɔ baobala bahi Moaba; ɔmɔ lina Ɔlipa mpe onkina lina Luta. O mbiha e mebu liomu, <verse eid="RUT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 1:5" />Maloni na Kilioni mpe baowa. Naomi aopali nko nde kaika, ngana mpamba mpe bome mpamba.<verse eid="RUT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Luta aoha mputa na Naomi o Bɛtɛlɛmɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 1:6" />Boiko Naomi akɔlɔngɔnɔki nde na makilo ma nande ma bainto nɔbɛlɛ o ehe e Moaba, na itina aokaki lotepwama mbɔ Nkolo aepwa bato banande nobabɛliela biomba bi ndei. <verse eid="RUT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 1:7" />Na boiko, babɛlɛki o ehe ɛlɔkɔ ekihaki nde na makilo noisia o Yuda; ya o mboka, <verse eid="RUT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 1:8" />Naomi aoywebia makilo ma nande ma bainto mbɔ: «Bɔnsɔ, boisia moto na moto onka nyango e nande. Tika Nkolo abokelele boboto nga bokelaki inyo onka bawi mpe onka mi mɔmɛnɛ! <verse eid="RUT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 1:9" />Tika Nkolo abopae ɔmɔ na ɔmɔ ɛmɛngɔ noyala o itumba inande i ibala!» Mpe Naomi aobabwatela nolamwa na balɔkɔ, ya balɔkɔ baototwa penda na bilelo. <verse eid="RUT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 1:10" />Ombiha baomoisenyele bɔnɛ: «Boiko pɔ! Tohaka mputa na wɛ kii o bokundu bɔwɛ.» <verse eid="RUT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 1:11" />Ya Naomi aisiaki nko nobaebia: «Bana bami ba bainto, boisia o makundu manyainyo. Itina iondi inyo noha mputa na mi be? Tingoisia nobota bamɔ bana ba mele baɔhɔ noisia nobobala<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kaki moto aowa ngana mpamba, mohikɔlɔ o nande, kaki tayali, na mpe moto ohangi na nde, aɔhɔ nobala ngainto oiko o etuka olongi abake bokundu bonka mowi. Ele monketo mobeya balɔkɔ «molongo», lendaka mpe Dut 25.5-10; Iba 38.6-8; Mat 22.24.</char></note>. <verse eid="RUT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 1:12" />Boisia onka inyo. Bonkambie. Na itina naya engambi tingoisia nobala. Na kaki mpe naohanga: “Nale na elikia nobota, mpe o botio bɔ lɛlɔ naoputana na mwele mpe naobota bana ba mele”, <verse eid="RUT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 1:13" />Bɔngɔhɔ nobalila kii oula balɔkɔ? Bongoyabaka noyala nko bala na boili balɔkɔ? Boiko pɔ, bana bami ba bainto! Na itina, mahɛi ma mi mapenda ma nyainyo, ikata inka Nkolo ionzokia liale penda.»<verse eid="RUT 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 1:14" />Na boiko, makilo ma mape ma bainto baisiaki nko nototwa na bilelo. Ombiha, Ɔlipa aobwatela nyango e na nde e bokilo nolamwa nande, ya Luta aondaki nko nolamema na nde. <verse eid="RUT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 1:15" />Na boiko, Naomi aoywebia Luta ndɛmbɔ: «Lenda, mokale mɔwɛ aisia o bokundu mpe onka ba nyambe ba nande. Isia nga bokela mokale mɔ wɛ, isia onka wɛ.» <verse eid="RUT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 1:16" />Ya Luta aomoisenyele: «Tonkamanyake mbɔ nakokambie mpe naisie onka mi. Nko manda ehaka wɛ, ehaka mpe mi; nko manda engokihe wɛ, engokihe mpe mi. Bokundu bɔ wɛ bongoyala mpe bo mi; Nyambe ɛ wɛ angoyala mpe Nyambe e mi. <verse eid="RUT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 1:17" />Nko manda engobu wɛ, engobu mi mpe engokundame mi. Tika Nkolo ampae ikamba ipenda kaki lobo lonkina notokapola mi na wɛ pɔ nko iwa!» <verse eid="RUT 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 1:18" />Naomi ɛnɛkɛ mbɔ Luta aana nko noha mputa na nde, taisia nomotepeya <verse eid="RUT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 1:19" />mpe bahaki mputa kii ɔ Bɛtɛlɛmɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 1:19">Na boiko, oiyaki balɔkɔ ɔ Bɛtɛlɛmɛ, inanga inkuma inyongaki na boili balɔkɔ. Bainto baemwaki: «Ɔnɛ nko Naomi?» <verse eid="RUT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 1:20" />Ya nde aobaisenyele ndɛmbo: «Tabombeyake Naomi nimbo mbɔ: “Ngainto o ibulwako!” Bombeye Mala nimbo mbɔ: “Ngainto o mahɛi penda!” Na itina Nkolo e Nguya Too Too aonzokia liale penda. <verse eid="RUT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 1:21" />Nahaki makata ntondiama mpe Nkolo e Nguya Too Too aonzisenya nko na makata. Taboisiaki nombeya Naomi, naitina Nkolo e nguya Too Too aɔnzɛlɛlɛ mɔkɔngɔ mpe aonzokia mahɛi.» <verse eid="RUT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 1:22" />Ɛlɔkɔ eiko Naomi abɛlɛki o ehe ɛ nɛnɛ e Moaba nde na Luta, bokilo bo nande bo ngainto bo mohi Moaba. Baiyaki ɔ Bɛtɛlɛmɛ o elaka ebanda balɔkɔ nonyuka mambo i ɔlɔzɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bambolukake mambo i ɔlɔzɛ o nsonge e inɛi na e itano.</char></note>.<verse eid="RUT 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="RUT 2" />
  <para style="s1">Luta atɔngɔnɔ mambo o itia inka Boazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 2:1" />Nsande Naomi aliki na moto ɔmɔ ohangemaki na bome o nande Elimɛlɛkɛ. Moto ɔlɔkɔ aliki mobati mpe mwebani, lina inande Boazi. <verse eid="RUT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 2:2" />Boina bɔmɔ, Luta e mohi Moaba aohangela Naomi bɔnɛ: «Ompae epohe natu nɔtɔngɔnɔ maopo makambia baluki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bambɔlɔ baliki na epohe nɔtɔngɔnɔkɔ maopo makambia baluki, lendaka Lew 19.9-10; Dut 24.19-21.</char></note>. Nakotana moto o boboto okompa epohe na matɔngɔne.» Naomi aomoisenyele bɔnɛ: «Nsɔkɔkɔ, ngana o mi o ngainto.» <verse eid="RUT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 2:3" />Luta ahaki mpe abandaki nɔtɔngɔnɔ maopo makambiaki baluki. Lendaka, lobo loliki bɔlɔti mpiko, itia ilɔkɔ iliki inka Boazi, ohangemaki na Elimɛlɛkɛ.<verse eid="RUT 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 2:4" />Ombiha e ngano elaka, Boazi aoyoima o Bɛtɛlɛmɛ. Aobeka baluki ntepela mbɔ: «Tika Nkolo ayale mputa na inyo!» Baomoisenyele bɔnɛ: «Tika Nkolo akotwakwele!» <verse eid="RUT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 2:5" />Boiko Boazi aoyoubola mokendii monka baluki: «Elɛngɛ ɛnɛ e ngainto ale nɔni?» <verse eid="RUT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 2:6" />Mɔkɛndii monka baluki aomoisenyele mbɔ: «Ale ɛlɛngɛ e ngainto e mohi Moaba, oyakaki nde na Naomi nyaima o ehe ɛnɛnɛ e Moaba. <verse eid="RUT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 2:7" />Amboubole epohe mbɔ atɔngɔne maopo makambia baluki. Amboye nko o mpendu mpe aɔlia nko lopwa.» <verse eid="RUT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 2:8" />Na boiko Boazi aohangela Luta: «Ngana o mi o ngainto, olangolaka ilako i mi. Tohake nɔtɔngɔnɔ maopo o itia inkina; yala nko anɛ mpe sala mputa na bahali ba mi ba bainto. <verse eid="RUT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 2:9" />Olendaka bɔlɔti o itia manda elukama maopo mpe oiyelaka bainto batɔngɔnɔ. Eba mbɔ naohangela bahali ba mi bakokambie nyɛ. Kaki oka mpoha nomina mai, ohaka nomina o bikutu bimbotokole balɔkɔ.» <verse eid="RUT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 2:10" />Na boiko Luta akukamaki na elongi ɔ lɔbɔmbi mpe amɔngɔnɔki, aohangela Boazi: «Onyamba na boboto bo lolenge lɔnɛ mpe oyapa na mi mobutu?» <verse eid="RUT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 2:11" />Boazi aomoisenyele ntepela mbɔ: «Bansɛkwela makela wɛ onga na nyango ɛ wɛ e bokilo ima owa bome ɔ wɛ, lolenge lokambia wɛ ihe ɛ wɛ, nyango ɛ wɛ mpe ehe ebotwaki wɛ noya nokiha o ehe enka bato bapa wɛ tweba boho. <verse eid="RUT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 2:12" />Tika Nkolo akoute na liko inkuma ikelaki wɛ. Oho, tika Nkolo, Nyambe enka Isalaele, akoute penda, na itina ele na boili nde oiyaki anɛ o manda e nande e mombami» <verse eid="RUT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 2:13" />Luta aoyoisenye bɔnɛ: «Wɛ ole moto mɔlɔti onga na mi, nkolo! Na itina onomboya mpe otepela na mi na boboto bonkuma, nsande timbe nzɛlɛmɛ nsa na ɔmɔ o bahali ba wɛ ba bainto.»<verse eid="RUT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 2:14" />O elaka e ndei, Boazi aohangela Luta bɔnɛ: «Yaka yɔle mputa na iho; pwa ɛti e ihɔ mpe okehube o bohaka.» Luta aokihi o ntundu enka baluki mpe Boazi aomopa mambo ibɔbwamaki. Aɔlɛ nga bondaki nde mpe aokambia bimɔ. <verse eid="RUT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 2:15" />Oisiaki nde noha nɔtɔngɔnɔ, Boazi atindaki bahali ba nande: «Bomokambie atɔngɔne na ile o iyɔngɔ na iyɔngɔ inka bibimba tabomɔpɛlɛke<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">na hɔlɔ epohe epaemaki nɔtɔngɔnɔ maopo nko kaki baluki baoheya lotomo lo balɔkɔ mpe kaki baumonya bibimba.</char></note>. <verse eid="RUT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 2:16" />Boumonyaka maopo mankina o bibimba mpe bomakambie ɔ lɔbɔmbi olongi amatɔngɔne. Ya lopenda, nko tabomɔpɛlɛke.» <verse eid="RUT 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 2:17" />Na boiko, Luta atongɔnɔki mambo o itia kii oiyaki mpokwa. Ombiha anyongelaki mambo itɔngɔnɔki nde, iliki bɛlɛbɛlɛ na ba kilo ntuku inɛi i ɔlɔzɛ.<verse eid="RUT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 2:18" />Luta aibebaki mpe abɛlɛki na ilɔkɔ o inanga mpe aoywɛnia nyango e nande e bokilo bitɔngɔnɔki nde. Amopaki mpe na biomba bipalemaki ɔlɛkɛki nde mpe aokinda. <verse eid="RUT 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 2:19" />Naomi amoubolaki: «Ɔmbɔtɔngɔne binɛ binkuma lɛlɔ o be? O itia ile obe imbosale wɛ? Tika Nkolo atwakwele oiko ombokokanene!»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 2:19">Na boiko, Luta ahangelaki nyango enande e bokilo mɔmɛnɛ itia isalaki nde. Moto ɔlɔkɔ lina i nande Boazi. <verse eid="RUT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 2:20" />Naomi ahangelaki bokilo bo nande bo ngainto bɔnɛ: «Naɛnɛ mbɔ Nkolo ale na boboto na iho bale na bɔmɔi mpe na baiko bawa. Tika atwakwele moto oiko!» Aisiaki notepela bɔnɛ: «Boazi ale ɔmɔ ohangi na iho, ale ɔmɔ o baeloli bayaiho<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boazi aliki o bokundu bonka Elimɛlɛkɛ (lendaka 2.1). Mweloli monka mowi aliki na epohe enkuma nwelola lɔbɔmbi lo nande mpe nolobatela o iyɔngɔ i bokundu, lendaka 4.1,8; Yil 32.7-9. O elaka eiko abɔtɔ nobaka monketo mo mpwi o molongo, lendaka mpe 1.11 mpe nkɛti 3.9 mpe na 4.5,14.</char></note>.» <verse eid="RUT 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 2:21" />Na boiko, Luta aomoisenyele bɔnɛ: «Ambosangele mbɔ natɔngɔne mputa na bahali ba nande kii o bouku bo malukelo.» <verse eid="RUT 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 2:22" />Na boiko, Naomi aohangela Luta, bokilo bo nande bo ngainto: «Ngana o mi o ngainto, ele bɔlɔti wɛ nosala na bahali ba nande ba bainto. Na itina kaki oha o itia inka moto onkina, ɔhɔ nɔnyɔkwama.» <verse eid="RUT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="RUT 2:23" />Luta aliki mputa na basali banka Boazi nɔtɔngɔnɔkɔ mambo kii o bouku bo malukelo ma mambo i ɔlɔzɛ mpe na i bule. Mpe akihaki nko nde na nyango nande e bokilo.<verse eid="RUT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="RUT 3" />
  <para style="s1">Luta aobetama o makaka manka Boazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 3:1" />Boina bɔmɔ, Naomi ahangelaki Luta bɔnɛ: «Ngana omi o ngainto, nakomba bwanya nokolondela bokianse bɔwɛ mbɔ ongoyale bɔlɔti o maina maoye. <verse eid="RUT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 3:2" />Nga bweba wɛ, Boazi boiko bokopa epohe nosala mputa na bahali ba nande ba bainto tohangi iho na nde. Lendaka, na mpokwa ɛnɛ, akonyongela mambo i ɔlɔzɛ o ehokielo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ehokielo ele manda elondama nokapola mambo na mpoho.</char></note>. <verse eid="RUT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 3:3" />Yakolaka, oyahinge malasi mpe lɔtɔkɔ monkoto mɔ wɛ. Ombiha, sulwaka ɔkɔ o ehokielo. Ya toyaɛniake onka moto oiko kii okoheya nde nɔlɛ mpe nomina. <verse eid="RUT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 3:4" />O elaka ekobetama nde, olendaka manda ɛkɔtwa nde, oiyaka mpiko ole nde mpe omokukolaka molangiti mpe obetamaka o makaka ma nande<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elembetelo eiko elimbola mbɔ Luta abondela onka Boazi amobatele, lendaka mɔlɔngɔ mo 9. Ɛɔhɔ mpe noyala nko hɔlɔ miamba me ibala; etumu e lobo etepwama o lokota lo ebele ele nobutola mputani enka ngainto na mwele.</char></note>. O mbiha ɛlɔkɔ angokwebia lɔhɔ wɛ nokela.» <verse eid="RUT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 3:5" />Luta aomoisenyele ndembɔ: «Nakokela inkuma ionsagela wɛ.»<verse eid="RUT 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 3:6" />Luta ahaki mpiko o manda eliki Boazi mpe akelaki inkuma nga bomotindaki nyango e nande e bokilo. <verse eid="RUT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 3:7" />Boazi alɛkɛki mpe aminaki, moloko mo nande moliki na ibulwako, o mbiha ahaki nobetama o ntundu e iboko i mambo. Na boiko, Luta aohaka bɔkɛ bɔkɛ, aokukola molangiti o makaka ma nande mpe aobeti. <verse eid="RUT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 3:8" />Na iyɔngɔ i botio, Boazi atolomwaki, aoyoka mpiɔ mpe aoyanana o mbiha aoywɛnɛ ngana o ngainto abeti o makaka ma nande. <verse eid="RUT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 3:9" />Boazi aomoubola bɔnɛ: «Wɛ nɔni?» Aomoisenyele bɔnɛ: «Ele mi, Luta, mohali mɔ wɛ mo ngainto. Tandaka lolemba lɔ wɛ lo etobo kii onka mi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tandaka lolemba lɔ wɛ lo etobo kii onka mi nimbo mbɔ: Ɔbɔtɔ nobala mohali mɔwɛ mo ngainto</char></note> na itina ole mweloli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iyumba inka mweloli: lendaka 2.20 mpe na nkɛti.</char></note>.» <verse eid="RUT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 3:10" />Na boiko, Boazi aomohangela ndɛmbɔ: «Ngana omi o ngainto, tika Nkolo akotwakwele! Oɛnia ipiki i wɛ o iyɔngɔ i bokundu bonka nyango ɛwɛ e bokilo penda nga bwɛniaki wɛ boho. Boiko, tokomba nolanga bilɛngɛ bi mele bi elele ɛ wɛ, babati mpe na bambɔlɔ. <verse eid="RUT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 3:11" />Aiko yoko, ngana omi o ngainto, toisiake nokiɛtɛnɛ! Nangokokelela inkuma ingoubole wɛ, na itina bato bankuma baeba mbɔ ole ngainto o loumu. <verse eid="RUT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 3:12" />Ele hɔlɔ mbɔ nale na lotomo onka wɛ lo mweloli, ya ele na moto ɔmɔ ompenda na mbila o bokundu bɔwɛ. <verse eid="RUT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 3:13" />Betama nko anɛ; na mpendu kaki aokwelola, aokwelola, ya kaki taimenya nokwelola, na boiko, mi nangokwelola. Betama nko anɛ kii mpendu. Nakɔlɔbwela o lina inka Nkolo ele na bɔmɔi mbɔ mi nangokwelola.»<verse eid="RUT 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 3:14" />Luta abetamaki o makaka manka Boazi kii oumbwaki boina, ya aumwaki na ntei e mpendu nani oliki boina moilima tabayaɛnɛ bilongi. Na itina Boazi ahangaki: «Tembe bɔlɔti lwebane mbɔ ngainto ɔnɛ amboye o manda ɛnɛ.» <verse eid="RUT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 3:15" />Boazi aomohangela bɔnɛ: «Ompae etobo eiko emboyahangie wɛ mpe okekate bɔlɔti.» Aokekati mpe aomotikela ba kilo i mambo i ɔlɔzɛ ntuku ipe mpe aomohunga nomobebia. O mbiha Boazi aoyoisie o inanga. <verse eid="RUT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 3:16" />Na boiko, Luta aisiaki onka nyango enande e bokilo. Aomoubola bɔnɛ: «Ngana o mi o ngainto, ya mbo ilɔkɔ ioleka bolobe?»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 3:16">Luta amɔhɛkwelaki inkuma imokelelaki Boazi. <verse eid="RUT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 3:17" />Mpe aisiaki nohanga: «Ambompae ba kilo inɛ ntuku ipe i mambo i ɔlɔzɛ ntepela mbɔ tingokoisiela makata boponga.» <verse eid="RUT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 3:18" />Naomi aotepela: «Kihaka, ngana o mi o ngainto, tolende nga bohaka lobo nohuka. Moloko monka moto oiko mokosulwa nko kaki lobo loiko lohila lɛlɔ!»<verse eid="RUT 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="RUT 4" />
  <para style="s1">Boazi aobala Luta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 4:1" />Boazi ahaki o moiho mo inanga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Moiho mo inanga eliki manda e nkumani: embokokanake bato notepela mbo, nɔtɛndɛkɛ makambo.</char></note>, mpe akihaki. Mweloli moliki na mbila penda na Elimɛlɛkɛ, oiko oebiaki nde Luta na boili nde alekaki aiko. Boazi aomobeya: «Yaka, kiha anɛ.» Moto oiko aɔtɛli mpe aokihi. <verse eid="RUT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 4:2" />Na boiko, Boazi aobeya mele liomu o iyɔngɔ inka bingambi bi inanga mpe aobahangela bɔnɛ: «Bokiha anɛ». Ohilaki balɔkɔ nokiha, <verse eid="RUT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 4:3" />Boazi aohangela mweloli bɔnɛ: «Oeba mbɔ Naomi aima o ehe ɛ nɛnɛ e Moaba. Mpe atɛkɛ lia iliki Elimɛlɛkɛ, moto ohangi na iho. <verse eid="RUT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 4:4" />Mi, nambwane nakwebie lobo loiko mpe nakwɛnie mbɔ ohombe lia liko o boho bonka bingambi mpe na bato bankina bale anɛ. Kaki ondi nwelola ibula iwɛ, elolaka, kaki mpamba, onzebie, na itina o mbiha ɛ wɛ, ele nko mi oho noiyelola.» Moeloli aohanga bɔnɛ: «Mi, naimenya nohomba lia.» <verse eid="RUT 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 4:5" />Boazi aisiaki nohanga bɔnɛ: «Boina bopwa wɛ lia o makata manka Naomi, nko boina boiko ongopwa mpe Luta mohi Moaba, noyala mwali ɔ wɛ olongi ibula liko i lia iyale nko o bokundu bonka bome ondande owa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lendaka 2.20 mpe na nkɛti.</char></note>.» <verse eid="RUT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 4:6" />Mweloli aomoisenyele ndɛmbo: «Kaki loya boiko, naoboya, noyala nko nopita lokutu lo mi mɔmɛnɛ. Wɛ elolaka ibula i mi, na itina tingɔhɔ nwelola.»<verse eid="RUT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 4:7" />O bilaka bileka, o Isalaele, kaki bato bayatɛkɛlɛ na mpe nwakola yomba, moto ɔmɔ aoyoumonya bikoto o makaka ma nande mpe aobipa onka moto onkina. Lɔlɔkɔ lwɛnia mbɔ ihomba iohila <verse eid="RUT 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 4:8" />Na itina ilɔkɔ, o elaka ehangelaki mweloli moiko mbɔ Boazi ahombe itia, atungolaki ekoto e nande mpe amopaki ɛlɔkɔ. <verse eid="RUT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 4:9" />Boiko, Boazi aohangela bingambi mpe bato bankuma baliki aiko: «Inyo boya menonga lɛlɔ nwɛnɛ lolenge lwelola mi ibula o makata manka Naomi lokutu lonkuma lonka Elimɛlɛkɛ na bana ba nande ba mele, Kilioni na Maloni. <verse eid="RUT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 4:10" />Nko aiko, naopwa mpe Luta mohi Moaba, ngainto o etuka enka Maloni noyala mwali omi, olongi lina inka mowi itɔlwame o ibula i nande noyala nkɔndwama onka bahikɔlɔ banande mpe na moloi mo ehe. Lɛlɔ boya menonga.» <verse eid="RUT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 4:11" />Bingambi na bato bankuma baliki aiko baoyoisenye bɔnɛ: «Oho, toya menonga. Tika Nkolo atwakwele ngainto ɔtwa o itumba i wɛ; ayale lo Laele na Lea babotaki bokundu bo Isalaele! Tika ibati i wɛ ipule o iyongɔ i bokundu bonka Epalata<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Laele na Lea: bali bape banka Yakobo, lendaka Iba 29.11. Epalata: lendaka 1.2 mpe na nkɛti.</char></note> mpe lina i wɛ iume o Bɛtɛlɛmɛ enkuma! <verse eid="RUT 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 4:12" />Tika Nkolo akopuliele ibotwa i wɛ na ɛlɛngɛ eiko e ngainto mpe bokundu bɔ wɛ boyale lo bonka Pɛlɛsɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pɛlɛsɛ ale nke ɛmɔ enka Boazi, lendaka 4.18-21; 1 Elak 2.5, 9-12.</char></note>, ngana o mwele onka Yuda na Tamala!»<verse eid="RUT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Boazi aopwa Luta o molongo; mabotameno manka Ɔbɛdɛ, monkana onka Dawidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 4:13" />Na boiko, Boazi apwaki Luta mwali o nande mpe baputanaki. Nkolo amokelelaki ngɔlu, aobata liemi mpe aobota ngana o mwele. <verse eid="RUT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 4:14" />Mpe bainto ba Bɛtɛlɛmɛ bahangelaki Naomi bɔnɛ: «Tika Nkolo aumiame! Nde okela mbɔ ekobotwamene lɛlɔ mweloli. Tika lina inka monkana ɔ wɛ iebane o Isalaele! <verse eid="RUT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 4:15" />Angwenza bɔmɔi bɔ wɛ mpe angokobatela o bongambi bɔwɛ. Bokilo bɔwɛ bo ngainto ale na motuya o maiho ma wɛ nopenda bana ba mele nsambo, na itina akolanga mpe aokobotela monkana o mwele.» <verse eid="RUT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 4:16" />Na boiko, Naomi aopwa ngana mpe aɔmɔlɛlɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mpe aɔmɔlɛlɛ: elembetelo e ibongo, nwɛlia na Iba 30.3-8; 48.5-12; 50.23.</char></note>, o mbiha aomobongola. <verse eid="RUT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 4:17" />Bainto bakihaki na balɔkɔ bɛlɛbɛlɛ baotepela mbɔ: «Naomi aobota ngana o mwele!» Mpe bamotikaki lina Ɔbɛdi. Boiko, Ɔbɛdi abotaki Yese, ihe enka Dawidi.<verse eid="RUT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maina manka ba nke banka Dawidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 4:18" />Lenda monkɔndu monka Dawidi nyaima onka Pɛlɛsɛ: Pɛlɛsɛ abotaki Esilɔni, <verse eid="RUT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 4:19" />Esilɔni abotaki Lama, Lama abotaki Aminadaba,<verse eid="RUT 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 4:20" />Aminadaba abotaki Nasɔni, Nasɔni abotaki Salama, <verse eid="RUT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 4:21" />Salama abotaki Boazi, Boazi abotaki Ɔbɛdi, <verse eid="RUT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 4:22" />Ɔbɛdi abotaki Yese mpe Yese abotaki Dawidi.<verse eid="RUT 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 4" />
</usx>